From bec2a2090242ba2c9b53e920de0b1696c32c983f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rolando Trevino <rolotrealanis@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 20:55:57 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] mfd: macsmc: Match the T6050 SMC

t6050-die0.dtsi describes the SMC as "apple,t6050-smc" alone, which no
driver matches in this tree, so on the J716s (MacBook Pro 16-inch, M5 Pro)
there was no SMC: no RTC, no power button or lid events, no reboot or
power-off, no SMC GPIOs (the trackpad's AFE reset is one of them).

Match the compatible in the driver. It takes the generic path, as the
"apple,t8103-smc" fallback did, which is how the J716s has been booting.
The j716c/t6050-platform branch matches the same string and adds a T6050
cell list on top; this entry is the part of that which a board needs
today, and the binding entry has the same shape as there.

Tested on J716s through the equivalent "apple,t8103-smc" fallback: RTC,
SMC input, reboot, macsmc-gpio and macsmc-low-gpio probe, and the
trackpad's AFE reset on gp1c works. Not built with this entry yet.

Signed-off-by: Rolando Trevino <rolotrealanis@gmail.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/apple,smc.yaml | 2 ++
 drivers/mfd/macsmc.c                                 | 1 +
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/apple,smc.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/apple,smc.yaml
index 8641aaeb432e..72429b1c3379 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/apple,smc.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/apple,smc.yaml
@@ -18,6 +18,8 @@ properties:
     oneOf:
       - description: T8152 SMC with read-only hardware monitoring.
         const: apple,t8152-smc
+      - description: T6050 SMC, matched by the driver on its own
+        const: apple,t6050-smc
       - items:
           - enum:
               - apple,t6020-smc
diff --git a/drivers/mfd/macsmc.c b/drivers/mfd/macsmc.c
index 546e5cdbb72a..e60e4dc160d9 100644
--- a/drivers/mfd/macsmc.c
+++ b/drivers/mfd/macsmc.c
@@ -585,6 +585,7 @@ static int apple_smc_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 
 static const struct of_device_id apple_smc_of_match[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "apple,t8152-smc" },
+	{ .compatible = "apple,t6050-smc" },
 	{ .compatible = "apple,t8103-smc" },
 	{ .compatible = "apple,smc" },
 	{},
-- 
